    "question": "If $x = a(\\theta - \\sin \\theta)$ and $y = a(1 - \\cos \\theta)$, find $dy/dx$. [2 marks]",
    "solutionSteps": [
      "$\\frac{dx}{d\\theta} = a(1-\\cos\\theta) = 2a\\sin^2(\\theta/2)$.",
