      "$\\frac{dy}{dx} = \\frac{4at \\sin 2t}{4at \\cos 2t} = \\tan 2t$.",
      "$\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2} = \\frac{d}{dt}(\\tan 2t) \\cdot \\frac{dt}{dx} = 2\\sec^2 2t \\cdot \\frac{1}{4at \\cos 2t} = \\frac{\\sec^3 2t}{2at}$."
    ],
    "finalAnswer": "$\\frac{\\sec^3 2t}{2at}$",
